    "updated_at": "2016-03-29T10:31:46Z",
    "body": "> potentially it's not great for cross-origin resources?\n\nAlthough I agree that ideally download start/finish events should be same-origin (and CORS)-only, timing information for cross-origin resource loading is already exposed via `<img onload=... onerror=...>` (not sure if this has been changed, please correct me if I'm wrong), so it wouldn't make much practical sense to limit the events to same-origin resources. Whether or not it's same-origin limited doesn't matter that much to me though, as I only need this event for same-origin blob object URLs.\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
